OL,3,GNEWSAPlans lodged for pharmacy in old
OL,4,Acommunity centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA disused community centre sold off by
OL,7,Fa city council could become an expanded
OL,8,Fpharmacy.
OL,10,FPlans have been submitted to
OL,11,FPeterborough City Council by Mohammed
OL,12,FTaseen, who runs Walton Chemist in the
OL,13,Fcity, to take over Walton Community
OL,14,FCentre in Mountsteven Avenue.
OL,16,FIt would mean moving from a small shop
OL,17,Funit on the same street and turning the
OL,18,Fmain hall and its kitchen into a
OL,19,Fpharmacy with private consultation
OL,20,Frooms, seated waiting area and
OL,21,Fdispensary.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
