OL,3,GNEWSAPlans lodged for pharmacy in old
OL,4,Acommunity centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe community centre closed in 2019 and
OL,7,Fwas disposed of by the city council
OL,8,Funder an assets review in October last
OL,9,Fyear, with a view to its change of use
OL,10,Fas a pharmacy.
